# 🛡️ CyberMind AI

### *AI-Powered Threat Detection & Security Monitoring System*

CyberMind AI is a **real-time AI-driven cybersecurity monitoring platform** designed to detect suspicious activities, analyze threats, and provide intelligent security insights using Machine Learning and Large Language Models (LLMs).

The platform combines:

* Anomaly Detection
* Threat Analytics
* AI-based Security Explanations
* Real-time Monitoring
* Persistent Alert Storage

to simulate a modern **Security Operations Center (SOC)** environment.

---

# 🚀 Features

## 🤖 AI Threat Detection

* Detects suspicious activities from security logs
* Identifies anomalies using Machine Learning
* Generates intelligent threat severity scores

---

## 📊 Real-Time Monitoring Dashboard

* Live security analytics
* Auto-refreshing dashboard
* Interactive charts & visualizations

---

## 🧠 AI Security Assistant

* Uses local LLMs (Ollama)
* Explains suspicious activities
* Answers cybersecurity-related questions

---

## 🔍 Anomaly Detection

Implements:

* Isolation Forest algorithm
* Behavioral anomaly analysis
* Suspicious activity classification

---

## 🚨 Threat Alert System

Detects:

* Brute-force login attempts
* Malware-like behavior
* Suspicious data transfers

---

## 💾 Persistent Storage

* SQLite database integration
* Stores users and threat alerts
* Maintains alert history

---

## 🔐 Authentication System

* User registration & login
* Session management
* Multi-user support foundation

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

```text id="o0fxnm"
Security Logs
      ↓
Feature Engineering
      ↓
Isolation Forest (ML)
      ↓
Threat Detection Engine
      ↓
Severity Scoring
      ↓
AI Threat Explanation (LLM)
      ↓
Dashboard + Alert System
```

