# ⚙️ Installation

## 1️⃣ Clone Repository

```bash id="d99lqe"
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/cybermind-ai.git
cd cybermind-ai
```

---

## 2️⃣ Install Dependencies

```bash id="9wxjci"
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 3️⃣ Install & Run Ollama

```bash id="pq09t5"
ollama run phi3
```

---

## 4️⃣ Start Application

```bash id="b76yxh"
streamlit run app.py
```

---

# 📊 Dashboard Features

* 📈 Failed login analytics
* 🦠 Malware activity monitoring
* 📡 Suspicious data transfer tracking
* 🚨 Real-time threat alerts
* 🤖 AI-generated security analysis

---

# 🧠 Machine Learning

CyberMind AI uses:

* **Isolation Forest**
  for anomaly detection on:
* failed login attempts
* malware scores
* unusual data transfers
* suspicious file access patterns

---

# 🤖 AI-Powered Analysis

The platform integrates a local LLM using **Ollama** to:

* explain threats
* identify attack patterns
* provide recommended actions
* act as a cybersecurity assistant chatbot

---

# 💾 Database

SQLite database stores:

* user accounts
* generated alerts
* monitoring history

---

# 🖥️ Technologies Used

| Category        | Technology       |
| --------------- | ---------------- |
| Frontend        | Streamlit        |
| Backend         | Python           |
| ML Model        | Isolation Forest |
| AI Engine       | Ollama           |
| Database        | SQLite           |
| Visualization   | Plotly           |
| Data Processing | Pandas           |

